<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About AI News | Latest Artificial Intelligence Updates</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='%232563eb'><path d='M12 2L2 7v10c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V7l-10-5z'/></svg>">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header">
        <nav class="nav">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon">AI</div>
                News
            </a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a>
                <a href="/about" class="nav-link">About</a>
            </div>
            <div class="search-container">
                <input type="text" class="search-input" id="nav-search" placeholder="Search AI news...">
                <svg class="search-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                    <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="language-selector">
                <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="en" onclick="setLanguage('en')">EN</button>
                <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="sv" onclick="setLanguage('sv')">SV</button>
                <button class="lang-btn" data-lang="de" onclick="setLanguage('de')">DE</button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="news">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 class="section-title">About AI News</h1>
                <div class="news-grid">
                    <article class="news-card animate-in" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
                        <div class="news-content">
                            <h2 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Mission</h2>
                            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">AI News is dedicated to providing comprehensive coverage of the latest developments in artificial intelligence. We believe in making AI news accessible, accurate, and engaging for everyone interested in this transformative technology.</p>
                            
                            <h2 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Our Categories</h2>
                            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We cover all major areas of AI including:</p>
                            <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">🤖</span> Machine Learning & Deep Learning</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">💬</span> Natural Language Processing & Language Models</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">👁️</span> Computer Vision</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">⚖️</span> AI Ethics & Regulation</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">🏢</span> Industry News</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">🔬</span> Research & Development</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0;">📚</span> Tutorials & Guides</li>
                            </ul>
                            
                            <h2 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Why Choose Us</h2>
                            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our website features modern, responsive design optimized for all devices. We prioritize fast loading times and SEO best practices to ensure our content reaches the right audience. All our articles are categorized and tagged for easy navigation and discovery.</p>
                            
                            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">We're committed to delivering high-quality, well-researched AI news that helps you stay informed about the latest technological advancements and their impact on society.</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h3>AI News</h3>
                    <p>Your trusted source for artificial intelligence news and updates.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h3>Quick Links</h3>
                    <ul class="footer-links">
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/search">Search</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h3>Categories</h3>
                    <ul class="footer-links" id="footer-categories">
                        <li><a href="/category/machine-learning">Machine Learning</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/category/deep-learning">Deep Learning</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/category/language-models">Language Models</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/category/computer-vision">Computer Vision</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h3>Stay Updated</h3>
                    <p>Subscribe to our newsletter for the latest AI news delivered to your inbox.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2024 AI News. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Setup navigation search
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const searchInput = document.getElementById('nav-search');
            if (searchInput) {
                let timeoutId;
                searchInput.addEventListener('input', function() {
                    clearTimeout(timeoutId);
                    timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {
                        const query = this.value;
                        if (query) {
                            window.location.href = '/search?q=' + encodeURIComponent(query);
                        }
                    }, 500);
                });
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>